title: Remove deprecated new_native_or_wasm_executor

doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    ## Summary

    - Remove `sc_service::new_native_or_wasm_executor`, which was deprecated for removal by end of 2024.
    - Use `sc_service::new_wasm_executor` instead.

crates:
- name: sc-service
  bump: major
